    'нелегал' => [
        'title' => 'Illegal',
        'year' => '2005',
        'type' => 'Feature Film',
        'logline' => 'An experienced agent is urgently recalled to his homeland and a new legend is developed for him. He must get a job at the Leningrad customs to ensure the safe transit of couriers with valuable microfilms.',
        'director' => 'Yuri Lebedev, Boris Frumin',
        'screenwriter' => 'Boris Frumin, Yuli Nikolin',
        'cinematographer' => 'Nikolai Volkov',
        'composer' => 'Viktor Lebedev',
        'production_designer' => 'Vladimir Svetozarov',
        'cast' => 'Alexey Serebryakov, Olga Albanova, Anatoly Petrov, Ekaterina Reshetnikova, Sergey Umanov, Artur Kharitonenko, Svetlana Obidina, Dmitry Sutyurin, Helga Filippova',
        'episodes' => '',
        'duration' => '1h 34min',
        'image' => 'images/nelegal.jpg',
        'description' => 'The seventies. The Cold War is in full swing, the USSR and the West are engaged in a tense struggle for each other\'s secrets. Soviet special services want to rid their couriers of the too close attention of customs officers at the Leningrad airport. These couriers deliver important documents obtained by our scouts in Western Europe to the USSR. It is decided to embed a GRU officer at the Leningrad customs. To do this, it is necessary to find a professional who will be completely unknown both in Moscow and in Leningrad and will not arouse suspicion among his future colleagues. To carry out such a responsible task, the Center returns to the Soviet Union its experienced agent (Alexey Serebryakov). This scout has been working in Helsinki for many years, and no one knows about him in the Motherland. Now, to work out his new legend and cope with the Center\'s task, the hero has to become an illegal again. Only this time — an illegal in his own country…'
    ],
