        'year' => '2006',
        'type' => 'TV Series',
        'logline' => 'At the center of the story is the life of the large Grinyov family over several years. Fate sometimes throws our heroes into difficult circumstances: Chechen captivity, a desert island, a luxurious foreign resort. But these are just decorations to show the formation of the characters\' character, their fates, and sometimes difficult choices.',
